{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-03-31 14:00:00', 'title': "PG&E'S 'SUSTAINABILITY BOND' TRANSACTION TO SUPPORT INVESTMENTS IN GRID RESILIENCE AND CARBON REDUCTION", 'text': "BOND ISSUANCE IS PG&E'S FIRST UNDER NEW SUSTAINABLE FINANCE FRAMEWORK FOCUSED ON GREEN AND SOCIAL PROJECTS OAKLAND, CALIF. , MARCH 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN SUPPORT OF ITS COMMITMENT TO HEALING THE PLANET AND KEEPING COSTS AS LOW AS POSSIBLE FOR CUSTOMERS, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (THE UTILITY AND TOGETHER WITH PG&E CORPORATION, PG&E) RECENTLY FINALIZED A $750 MILLION SUSTAINABILITY BOND ISSUANCE."}